* {{l|ru|ку́бовина|t=[[convexity]]}}

===Etymology 3===
{{clipping|ru|ку́бовый краси́тель|t=[[vat dye]]}}, from {{m|ru|ку́бовый|t=related to dye vatting}}, from {{m|ru|куб|t=large tank, [[vat]]}}, see above.

====Noun====
